# The "shared drive" holds large, generated content that does not belong in git.
# Only the config hierarchy is committed; the assets and renders below are
# produced by the asset tool or by renders. (Software lives in conda_recipes/ and
# is published to an S3 Conda channel — not here.)

# Generated sample assets (.blend files) and render outputs.
assets/
renders/

# Keep the directory structure so paths resolve on a fresh checkout.
!.gitkeep
